### 3. Cache Directory — [cache/.gitkeep](file:///c:/programe/GitHub/U-hack/llm-integration/cache/.gitkeep)

Empty directory for storing pre-generated demo payloads. To generate a demo cache:

```bash
cd llm-integration
python -c "
from src.pipeline import run_pipeline
import pathlib
p = run_pipeline(<match_id>)
pathlib.Path('cache/demo_<match_id>.json').write_text(p.model_dump_json(indent=2))
"
```

