## How to Run

```bash
# Terminal A — Start the API server
cd llm-integration
uvicorn src.api.server:app --reload --port 8000

# Terminal B — Start the frontend (Phase 5+)
cd frontend
bun dev
```

The `--reload` flag enables hot-reload during development.

